  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileESimNotSupportedOnSelectedSlot:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ສະລັອດ SIM ທີ່ເລືອກບຮອງຮັບ eSIM.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Connections_MobileBroadband_ESim_AddProfileESimNotSupportedOnAnySlot:
