  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_AppBatteryUsage_NeverAllow:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ບໍ່ເລີຍ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_AppBatteryUsage_ManagedByWindows:
