  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Advanced_Sharing\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=LO-LA: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການແຊຣ໌ຂັ້ນສູງ
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Advanced_Sharing\AdditionalDescription:
